WEBVTT

00:02:58.476 --> 00:03:00.916
It also helped me become
much less of a jerk.

00:03:01.636 --> 00:03:04.156
There are so many reasons
to eat plant-based,

00:03:04.196 --> 00:03:06.676
and any reason that resonates with you

00:03:06.676 --> 00:03:08.196
is the best reason.

00:03:08.796 --> 00:03:10.796
I understand it's not always easy.

00:03:11.196 --> 00:03:13.476
But eating even one plant-based meal a day

00:03:13.516 --> 00:03:15.196
makes a huge difference.

00:03:15.876 --> 00:03:17.876
I used to be a long time meat eater.

00:03:17.916 --> 00:03:21.276
As a "regular" chef,
I used to cook lots of meat

00:03:21.276 --> 00:03:23.236
and never made that connection

00:03:23.276 --> 00:03:25.196
that they're living beings just like us,

00:03:25.196 --> 00:03:27.716
with feelings, emotions and families.

00:03:28.076 --> 00:03:31.276
I'm now on a mission to unleash
the mighty power of plants,